    <!-- Initial forbidden-word list, shared by merchant reviews and local
         content comments. Matching folds case and accents and is anchored
         on whole words (see models/moderation_forbidden_word.py), so one
         spelling per word is enough: 'imbécil' also catches 'IMBECIL'.
         Every entry is reviewable here; administrators archive or extend
         the list from Settings > Moderation > Forbidden Words. -->

    <!-- Legacy lists, merged: memoria_viva (49 rows) + partner_reviews
         (22 rows) from the pre-reform production database, deduplicated
         by accent folding (cabron/cabrón, jodete/jódete...). Kept verbatim
         as a client decision (2026-09-22), including the broad everyday
         words (asco, odio, paja, tonto, basura, racista): a hit only holds
         the comment for review, it never rejects it. -->
